erid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
