     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">OK I have a partial solution that duplicates the module only <i>once</i>. Looks like you have to manually create x uiOutput placeholder to duplicate the module x times.<br><br>here is the code to duplicate it <i>once</i>.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div></div></code></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#Dynamically adding modules</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#slider module ------------------------</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sliderUI </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      ns </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NS</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tagList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</spa